---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Alex Papineau"
	description="Background, experience, technical stack, and software development philosophy."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-01-01')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Hello! I'm <strong>Alex Papineau</strong>, a software engineer and builder passionate about crafting high-performance web applications, developer tooling, and interactive experiences.
	</p>

	<h2>Background & Philosophy</h2>
	<p>
		I believe in writing clean, resilient, and accessible code. Whether building full-scale client platforms, performant serverless backends, or exploratory canvas simulations, my focus is always on simplicity, speed, and user experience.
	</p>

	<h2>Technical Focus</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Frontend:</strong> TypeScript, React, Astro, Vue, Tailwind CSS, HTML5 Canvas</li>
		<li><strong>Backend & Cloud:</strong> Node.js, Cloudflare Workers, REST/GraphQL APIs, Serverless Architecture</li>
		<li><strong>Tooling & Systems:</strong> Git, CI/CD pipelines, Vite, Linux/Unix environments</li>
		<li><strong>Creative Coding:</strong> Cellular automata, procedural simulations, interactive mapping</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Interested in collaborating or discussing an upcoming project? Feel free to reach out via the <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a> or explore my work on <a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
